# Ashdig (CIPlay vi_ashdig; VI1 vehicle island): quest "The Last Load", the six steps in order
island Ashdig
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Last Load
expect hidden assaybox
zone dig
expect step 1
read Foreman's tally
expect step 2
kill Screecher
expect animals Screecher 0
expect step 3
use leadwagon
expect message waits for its load
open First sample box
wait 2
open Second sample box
wait 2
open Third sample box
wait 2
expect story oresample 3
expect step 4
use leadwagon
expect story loaded 1
expect shown assaybox
expect step 5
open Assay box
wait 2
expect item TitaniumOre 1
expect done
